    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, EranWickramaratne, Acting Minister of Finance of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose, inrespect of the list of commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the ratesspecified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
